stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> DRAFT: Create as draft
    [*] --> PUBLISHED: Create as published
    DRAFT --> PUBLISHED: Publish in the course form
    PUBLISHED --> DRAFT: Only if all enrollment records are cancelled or absent
    DRAFT --> ARCHIVED: Explicit Archive action
    PUBLISHED --> ARCHIVED: Explicit Archive action
    note right of ARCHIVED
        Read-only course and materials
        No new enrollment or promotion
        Waitlist entries become CANCELLED
        Existing ENROLLED and COMPLETED access remains
    end note
